617413/sen-bernie-sanders-on-gop-efforts-to-replace-obamacare"},{"date":"Jul 26, 2017","position":6,"site_name":"www.govinfo.gov","snippet":"Last night the Senate considered a comprehensive ObamaCare repeal-and- replace substitute. That amendment was subject to a 60-vote threshold be-","title":"Congressional Record","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CREC-2017-07-26/pdf/CREC-2017-07-26-senate.pdf"},{"date":"9 years ago","position":7,"site_name":"www.facebook.com","snippet":"\" Senator Bernie Sanders passionately made his objections known at the US Senate began its effort to repeal Obamacare http://cnn.it/2iKPsTv.","title":"\"Because if you have no health insurance and you can't go to a ...","url":"https://www.facebook.com/cnn/videos/because-if-you-have-no-health-insurance-and-you-cant-go-to-a-doctor-or-a-hospita/10155899111336509/"},{"position":8,"site_name":"www.c-span.org","snippet":"The Senate voted 51-48 to pass a fiscal year 2017 budget resolution, which included instructions to committees to write Affordable Care Act ...","title":"Senate Vote on Instructions to Repeal the Affordable Care Act","url":"https://www.c-span.org/program/us-senate/senate-vote-on-instructions-to-repeal-the-affordable-care-act/466696"},{"date":"Jan 11, 2017","position":9,"site_name":"www.congress.gov","snippet":"Tonight, Senators from both parties will have an important opportunity to take a vote on the legislative tools nec- essary to repeal ObamaCare.","title":"Congressional Record","url":"https://www.congress.gov/115/crec/2017/01/11/163/7/CREC-2017-01-11-senate.pdf"},{"position":10,"site_name":"www.burlingtonfreepress.com","snippet":"Sen. Bernie Sanders delivered a speech on the Senate floor last night regarding Republicans' health care plan, June 20, 2017.","title":"Sanders Floor Speech on Health Care","url":"https://www.burlingtonfreepress.com/videos/news/2017/06/20/sanders-floor-speech-health-care/103041786/"}],"total_results":10,"page":0}